    },
    "body": "## Outcome\n\nMakes predictive geometric connection memory the single current UOR-R4\ndirection after PR #997, while preserving every historical measurement and\nnegative result.\n\n## What changes\n\n- adds ADR-0005 with the architecture, causal boundary, controls, outcome\n  branches, and literature basis;\n- makes `PredictiveConnectionRetentionGate0V1` the immediate stop-first #973\n  action before the protected D3 held-out join;\n- reconciles README, ROADMAP, AGENTS, programme, evaluation, research,\n  lifecycle, glossary, explainers, crate READMEs, issue forms, and historical\n  authority headers;\n- appends forward-disposition notes to the completed #973 evidence records;\n  and\n- leaves code, serving behavior, artifact bytes, and historical claims\n  unchanged.\n\nLive #820, #973, #954, #969, #989, #953, and milestone 21 were reconciled in\nparallel with this documentation change. Native blocker relationships remain\nunchanged.\n\n## Evidence boundary\n\nThis PR establishes a design and execution contract only. It does not claim\nthat predictive connection memory, geometric attention, coherent generation,\ncorrectness, or reasoning is already qualified.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py`\n- `git diff --check`\n- both edited GitHub issue templates parse as YAML\n\nReferences #973\n",
